  "description": "Abstention development set. NOT the release gate: it is never scored as the gate, and the gate sets (questions.json, questions-v2.json) were neither changed nor used to tune it. Abstain items are new questions in three families (per-request model outputs and reach, live configuration and production metrics, moderation claims the code does not state); their probes must return no hits. Answer items are controls next to those families, written by reading the code at the pinned commit (no research finding behind them, so source is null), so that a stricter abstention contract cannot score well by abstaining on everything.",
